== Fine-Tuning Process
<fine-tuning-process>
The fine-tuning process consists of the following steps:

+ #strong[Load Pre-trained Model];: Load a base model (e.g., GPT-2,
  BERT)

+ #strong[Prepare Dataset];: Format your custom data appropriately

+ #strong[Tokenization];: Convert text to tokens using the model's
  tokenizer

+ #strong[Training Configuration];: Set hyperparameters (epochs, batch
  size, learning rate)

+ #strong[Train Model];: Update all model weights on your dataset

+ #strong[Save Model];: Save the fine-tuned model for inference

