=== Future Directions in PEFT Research
<future-directions-in-peft-research>
#strong[\1. Automatic Architecture Search:]

Learn optimal PEFT configuration:

$ \( alpha^(*) \, r^(*) \, upright("modules")^(*) \) = arg max_(alpha \, r \, M) frac(upright("Accuracy") \( M \, r \, alpha \), upright("Cost") \( M \, r \)) $

#strong[\2. Dynamic PEFT:]

Adjust adapter capacity during training:

$ r_t = r_0 + Delta r dot.op upright("schedule") \( t \) $

#strong[\3. Mixture of Adapters:]

Route inputs to specialized adapters:

$ y = sum_(i = 1)^K upright("Gate") \( x \)_i dot.op f_(Delta_i) \( x \) $

#strong[\4. Sparse PEFT:]

Activate only relevant adapter subsets:

$ Delta W = upright("TopK") \( { Delta W_i }_(i = 1)^N \) $

