=== Complete Training Pipeline
<complete-training-pipeline>
#strong[Training Objective Revisited:]

For instruction fine-tuning, we maximize the log-likelihood of outputs
given instructions and inputs:

$ cal(L) \( theta \) = bb(E)_(\( I \, x \, y \) tilde.op cal(D)) [sum_(t = 1)^(\| y \|) log P_theta \( y_t \| I \, x \, y_(< t) \)] $

With loss masking (only computing loss on output tokens):

$ cal(L)_(upright("masked")) \( theta \) = bb(E)_(\( I \, x \, y \) tilde.op cal(D)) [sum_(t = m + 1)^n log P_theta \( s_t \| s_(< t) \)] $

where $s = \[ I \, x \, y \]$ is the full sequence, $m$ is the length of
instruction+input, and $n$ is the total length.

#strong[Training Hyperparameters:]

