#strong[Multi-Label Toxicity Detection:]

Classify text across multiple toxicity dimensions:

$ hat(y) = sigma \( W dot.op upright("encode") \( x \) + b \) $

where $hat(y) in \[ 0 \, 1 \]^K$ for $K$ toxicity categories.

