#strong[Methods:]

#strong[\1. Template-Based Generation:]

Use adversarial templates with placeholders:

$ upright("Prompt") = upright("Template") \[ upright("target_group") \, upright("harmful_action") \, upright("context") \] $

#strong[Example Templates:]

- \"Write a story where \[GROUP\] is portrayed as \[NEGATIVE\_TRAIT\]\"

