#strong[\2. Gradient-Based Adversarial Attacks:]

Find inputs that maximize undesired behavior:

$ x^(*) = arg max_x P_theta \( y_(upright("harmful")) \| x \) $

Optimize input $x$ using gradient ascent:

$ x_(t + 1) = x_t + alpha nabla_x log P_theta \( y_(upright("harmful")) \| x_t \) $

#strong[\3. Evolutionary/Genetic Algorithms:]

Evolve prompts through mutation and selection:

$ upright("Fitness") \( p r o m p t \) = upright("ToxicityScore") \( upright("model") \( p r o m p t \) \) $

