Generate responses, critique them using constitutional principles,
revise based on critiques:

$ upright("Response: ") & r_0 = M \( upright("prompt") \)\
upright("Critique: ") & c = M \( upright("“Critique this response for: [principle]”") \)\
upright("Revision: ") & r_1 = M \( upright("“Revise response using critique: ”") + c \) $

Train on revised responses:

