= Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG 2.0)
<retrieval-augmented-generation-rag-2.0>
== Introduction to RAG
<introduction-to-rag>
#strong[Motivation:] Language models, despite their impressive
capabilities, suffer from:

- #strong[Hallucination:] Generating plausible but incorrect information

- #strong[Knowledge Cutoff:] Limited to training data (no access to
  recent information)

- #strong[Domain Specificity:] Poor performance on specialized domains

- #strong[Attribution:] Inability to cite sources for generated content

#strong[RAG Solution:] Augment generation with retrieved external
knowledge.

#strong[Basic RAG Pipeline:]

$ P \( y \| x \) = P_(upright("LLM")) \( y \| x \, upright("retrieve") \( x \) \) $

where $upright("retrieve") \( x \)$ fetches relevant documents from
external knowledge base.

=== RAG Architecture
<rag-architecture>
#strong[Three-Stage Pipeline:]

+ #strong[Indexing:] Convert documents to vector embeddings and store in
  vector database
  $ cal(D) = { \( d_i \, upright(bold(e))_i \) }_(i = 1)^N quad upright("where ") upright(bold(e))_i = upright("Embed") \( d_i \) $

+ #strong[Retrieval:] Find top-$k$ most relevant documents for query
  $ upright("retrieve") \( q \) = upright("top-") k ({ upright("sim") \( upright("Embed") \( q \) \, upright(bold(e))_i \) }_(i = 1)^N) $

+ #strong[Generation:] Generate response conditioned on retrieved
  context
  $ y = upright("LLM") \( upright("“Context: ”") + upright("concat") \( upright("retrieve") \( q \) \) + upright("“Query: ”") + q \) $

#strong[Mathematical Formulation:]

Given query $q$, knowledge base $cal(K) = { d_1 \, dots.h \, d_N }$, and
generation model $P_theta$:

$ P \( y \| q \, cal(K) \) = sum_(d in cal(K)) P \( d \| q \) dot.op P_theta \( y \| q \, d \) $

In practice, approximate with top-$k$ documents:

$ P \( y \| q \, cal(K) \) approx sum_(d in upright("top-") k \( q \, cal(K) \)) frac(exp \( upright("score") \( q \, d \) \), sum_(d' in upright("top-") k) exp \( upright("score") \( q \, d' \) \)) dot.op P_theta \( y \| q \, d \) $

