=== Question Type 2: Comparative Analysis
<question-type-2-comparative-analysis>
#strong[Sample Question:] \"Compare LoRA and QLoRA in terms of memory
efficiency, training speed, and accuracy. When would you choose one over
the other?\"

#strong[Answer Framework:]

#strong[Memory Efficiency:]
$ upright("LoRA:") & quad M = frac(N times 16, 8) + upright("adapters") approx 2 N upright(" bytes")\
upright("QLoRA:") & quad M = frac(N times 4, 8) + upright("adapters") approx 0.5 N upright(" bytes")\
upright("Ratio:") & quad frac(Q L o R A, L o R A) = frac(0.5 N, 2 N) = 0.25 upright(" (75%reduction)") $

#strong[Training Speed:]

- LoRA: Faster (no quantization/dequantization overhead)

- QLoRA: 10-20% slower due to 4-bit operations

- Both significantly faster than full fine-tuning

#strong[Accuracy:]

- LoRA: Virtually identical to full fine-tuning ($<$0.5% drop)

- QLoRA: Slight degradation (0.5-2% drop)

- Both sufficient for most applications

#strong[Decision Criteria:]

- Choose #strong[QLoRA] if: GPU memory $<$ 16 GB, model $>$ 7B params

- Choose #strong[LoRA] if: GPU memory $>$ 16 GB, need faster training

