#strong[Step-by-step:]

+ Load model weights from checkpoint (typically 500MB-2GB for GPT-2,
  5-20GB for GPT-3 variants)

+ Load corresponding tokenizer (converts text $arrow.l.r$ token IDs)

+ Detect GPU availability---evaluation runs 10-50x faster on GPU

