deployment = LLMServing.bind(model_path="gpt2-finetuned-medical")
serve.run(deployment, name="llm-api", route_prefix="/generate")
```

#strong[What happens under the hood:]

+ #strong[serve.start():] Initializes Ray cluster, starts HTTP server on
  port 8000

+ #strong[.bind():] Creates deployment object with specified model path

+ #strong[serve.run():] Launches 4 replicas (from num\_replicas=4)

+ #strong[Each replica:]

  - Runs \_\_init\_\_ (loads model, ~5 seconds)

  - Registers with load balancer

  - Starts accepting requests at http:\/\/localhost:8000/generate

+ #strong[Load balancer:] Round-robin distributes requests across 4
  replicas

