+ #strong[Cost Optimization Priority:]

  + Caching (30-50% savings, easiest to implement)

  + Quantization (50-75% savings, requires careful validation)

  + Batching (5x throughput, increases latency)

  + Autoscaling (40-60% savings during off-peak)

  Implement in this order for maximum ROI.

